WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.010
Guide two: a quick tour of your Studio.

2
00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.508
Your Studio is one page in your

3
00:00:05.508 --> 00:00:07.133
browser. It runs on your own

4
00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:09.163
computer, with no account to log in

5
00:00:09.163 --> 00:00:11.426
to. To open it, tell your assistant:

6
00:00:11.426 --> 00:00:12.794
open my studio.

7
00:00:13.394 --> 00:00:15.508
This bar shows how far you've got:

8
00:00:15.508 --> 00:00:17.250
set up, your channel, your first

9
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.469
video, published, and autopilot.

10
00:00:20.069 --> 00:00:22.167
The orange box always shows the one

11
00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:23.480
thing to do next.

12
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.943
Click its button.

13
00:00:25.543 --> 00:00:27.262
Needs you lists every decision

14
00:00:27.262 --> 00:00:29.204
waiting for you, like your yes to an

15
00:00:29.204 --> 00:00:31.566
upload. Each one is a click or two.

16
00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:34.046
The Autopilot card shows what's been

17
00:00:34.046 --> 00:00:35.727
spent this week, against the limit

18
00:00:35.727 --> 00:00:36.569
you set.

19
00:00:37.169 --> 00:00:38.787
On the right are your videos, and

20
00:00:38.787 --> 00:00:40.259
how far along each one is.

21
00:00:40.259 --> 00:00:41.651
Click one to open it.

22
00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:44.095
The Videos tab lists every video

23
00:00:44.095 --> 00:00:46.315
with a calendar of release days.

24
00:00:46.915 --> 00:00:49.251
Your channel holds the big choices:

25
00:00:49.251 --> 00:00:51.251
how you start, the look, the voice

26
00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:53.696
the name, and how often you post.

27
00:00:54.296 --> 00:00:57.080
Set up holds your services and your keys.

28
00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:59.023
Stuck? Click Help.

29
00:00:59.023 --> 00:01:00.835
Common questions are answered right

30
00:01:00.835 --> 00:01:02.544
there. Anything else goes to your

31
00:01:02.544 --> 00:01:03.886
own AI assistant.

32
00:01:04.486 --> 00:01:06.616
Next: how to pick your niche.
